MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Tia_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Tia_m01_001: Lots of worshippers, temple soldiers, and even some\npriests have vanished over the years.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Tia_m01_002: Where could they have disappeared to? This is a very\npublic place. It shouldn't be possible.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Tia_m01: <BLN>It shouldn't be possible...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Pet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Pet_m01_001: I wonder if my mom already knew Castor was sick.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Pet_m01_002: She probably did. Probably already knew about the\ndeath sentence too, I bet.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Pet_m01_003: She probably knew all those secrets, but didn't let us\nkids know about any of it.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Pet_m01_004: Grown-ups are weird. But they're awesome too,\nright? I mean, they're still weird...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Pet_m01_005: Well, we should probably get back to searching\nthe temple.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Pet_m01: <BLN>I was just thinking...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m01_001: Cai, I'm trusting you to handle the search of the\ntemple's interior.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m01_002: Since I cannot leave my chambers, I ask that you\nplease come tell me about anything of interest.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Aur_m01: <BLN>I trust you...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m01_001: It was a priest who vanished. The gatekeeper on\nduty confirmed he didn't see the person leave.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m01_002: If bandits are behind this, they'd have been noticed\nby someone—or have left a trace of their crime.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m01_003: I've been reading old temple records, and the first\ndisappearance occurred 80 years ago.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m01_004: The year after that, priests, worshippers, and several\ntemple visitors all vanished in quick succession.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m01_005: There was an enormous commotion about it all, but\nno one was able to solve the mystery.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m01_006: In recent years, it's happened less and less often. So,\nwho's really behind it—one person, all this time?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Cen_m01: <BLN>It's a mystery...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Hur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Hur_m01_001: I hate admitting it, but sometimes the temple has...\nI don't know. I've just had weird feelings in here.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Hur_m01_002: Sometimes, even though there couldn't have been\nanyone there, I've been sure I wasn't alone.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Hur_m01_003: There's been times when I'd swear I heard a voice\ncall my name, but there'd be no one else around.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Hur_m01_004: It's all just...ugh. I hate feeling scared like this.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Hur_m01: <BLN>Want to hear something scary?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B01_m01_001: People have long vanished from this temple. We've\nbeen sent to help with the investigation this time.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B01_m01_002: Between you and me, there's a rumor that Aurora\nhas been eating the people that disappeared.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B01_m01_003: And, you know, she does have Balor's blood in her.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B01_m01_004: Hey, did you kids come today to offer prayers or\nsomething? That's too bad...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B01_m01_005: We aren't to let anybody leave until we sort what's\nhappening. You might not be able to go home today.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_B01_m01: <BLN>Another disappearance...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Miw_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Miw_m01_001: All of 'em, every one... All gone off to paradise...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Miw_m01_002: Stay here too long, and you may join them in the\nparadise of the gods, White Canyon Zanado.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Miw_m01_003: *sigh* Nobody pays attention when I talk about\nthese things.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Miw_m01: <BLN>Paradise eats people up...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Miw_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Miw_m02_001: That young priest woman was taken by the painting!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Miw_m02_002: All of them, they're all taken to paradise! I can never\ndo anything to stop it!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Miw_m02: <BLN>I can never do anything to stop it...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m02_001: Whatever could have happened to Ultand? Cai, will\nyou please go take a look around the reception hall?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Aur_m02: <BLN>What happened to her?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03_001: Cai, would you mind coming back to see me\non {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default}?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03_002: Until then, I'm going to try to learn as much as I can\nabout Zenzele.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03_003: Please make sure you're fully prepared by then.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03_004: You know, I have also been thinking of all the lovely\nstories that Ultand has told me of her family.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03_005: Whenever I hear her tales, I'm reminded of the very\nhappy days I once spent with my parents.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03_006: My darling mother, full of kindness... But who also\nhad such a sad side to her...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03_007: And my dear father... He'd throw all official duties\naside if I ever got ill, however mildly...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03_008: But after his part in...what happened later...we had\nour falling out. I pushed him away entirely.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03_009: I suppose that I've been running from him ever\nsince. Not so much locked up as, well...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03_010: ...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03_011: I've even started to consider something else. *sigh*\nThat...I might not really be Father's child.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03_012: I'm scared to learn the answers to so many\nquestions I've pondered in private.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Aur_m03: <BLN>I'm worried about Ultand...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m04_001: Cai, I'm glad to see you. I've learned a great deal\nabout Zenzele.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m04_002: A lot of things make sense to me now, and I'd like to\nexplain it all to you...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Aur_m04_003: but, more importantly, we must help Ultand.\nI'm so worried about her.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Aur_m04: <BLN>A lot of things make sense now...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Tia_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Tia_m02_001: I want to help however I can.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Tia_m02_002: That's why I've been reading all about your\ngreat-grandpa, Balor.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Tia_m02_003: Balor's always been seen as tremendously strong.\nA god capable of ruling the entire underworld.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Tia_m02_004: If we accept that Drake's treasures are truly pieces\nof Balor's corpse, then...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Tia_m02_005: the power of these treasures is likely drawn up\nfrom the underworld, via the corpse.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Tia_m02_006: I think that would explain their extraordinary power,\ndon't you?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Tia_m02_007: Think about it. Your jewel, Theodora's arm, the bow\nwe saw Inyoni using...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Tia_m02_008: Honestly, all of it could be related to the temple\ndisappearances and that strange painting.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Tia_m02_009: I wonder if it really is OK for regular humans to keep\nusing such power.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Tia_m02: <BLN>I've been reading...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Pet_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Pet_m02_001: I hope Ultand's OK. It's so scary...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Pet_m02_002: Ugh...I've got to keep it together. For Ultand's sake!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Pet_m02_003: I keep imagining getting dragged inside a painting.\nI don't like it. Not at all.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Pet_m02_004: But, with your mom helping us, we'll be OK. Right?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Pet_m02: <BLN>I've got to keep it together!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m02_001: I only hope that Ultand is safe and sound.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m02_002: She must be experiencing fearsome things within the\npainting. We must save her as soon as we can.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m02_003: Recommending Ultand, young as she was, to be\nAurora's companion and caretaker was my doing.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m02_004: I simply thought the two of them would get along\nwell, but...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m02_005: I don't think I could fathom the depths of Aurora's\nloneliness. Ultand has been a healing force for her.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m02_006: Moreover, Cai, I know Ultand has come to care for\nyou as if you were her younger brother.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m02_007: There are none in this temple that could replace her.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m02_008: Although, I suppose I doubt that any one person can\nsimply be replaced by another.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cen_m02_009: But Ultand... Well, I will revisit that thought\nanother time.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Cen_m02: <BLN>We must save her...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cas_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cas_m01_001: Sick? You think I'm sick? Don't be silly.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cas_m01_002: Who put that idea in your head anyway?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cas_m01_003: Sheesh...people in this city.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cas_m01_004: ...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cas_m01_005: Cai... I don't know what to say. This isn't funny.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Cas_m01_006: Just go home for today, will you? And...maybe don't\nworry about coming back for a while.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Cas_m01: <BLN>Who put that idea in your head?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Buc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Buc_m01_001: After what happened, I went immediately to milady\nand apologized. She has forgiven me for now.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Buc_m01_002: I doubt this has resolved Lady Leda's desire\nfor revenge.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Buc_m01_003: But it will slow her, if just for a while. A pause that I\nbelieve will serve her.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_Buc_m01_004: You've been a great help, Cai. Allow me to\nthank you.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_Buc_m01: <BLN>Allow me to thank you.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B02_m01_001: Who are you? What day is it?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B02_m01_002: Today feels like yesterday, while tomorrow feels\nthe same as today. Maybe I've lost my mind.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B02_m01_003: Where is Morrow? Where has my little boy gone?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_B02_m01: <BLN>What day is it?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B03_m01_001: I get to live with my family in paradise! It's so\npeaceful here.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B03_m01_002: Why are you making that face? You don't look happy\nfor me.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_B03_m01: <BLN>So peaceful...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B04_m01_001: Huh? How did I get here?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c09_B04_m01_002: I came with my family to offer prayers to Aurora\nand then... Um, after that we... After that...
MID_LGA_1KAI_c09_B04_m01: <BLN>How did I...